course: dictionary
lesson: 7807
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 2
explain: One word can have more than one meaning, and the words around it tell you which meaning the writer wants. This is called context. «The Queen of England waved from the balcony.» Here queen means a woman who rules a country.
explain: «The queen bee lays the eggs for the whole hive.» The same word now means a special female insect. Nothing about a country or a crown is needed to understand it. The clues are bee and hive.
explain: Always ask: which meaning fits this sentence? Then put your meaning in place of the word and check that the sentence still makes sense.
fact: Queen means a woman who rules a country, usually because she was born into the royal family.
fact: Queen also means the wife of a king.
fact: In chess, the queen is the strongest piece. In cards, the queen is a picture card.
fact: A queen bee or queen ant is the one female that lays all the eggs in the colony.
fact: «Queen of hearts» is a phrase, and «crowned queen» means a queen who has been given a crown.
exercise: «The queen bee lays the eggs for the whole hive.» What does queen mean here? | *A female insect that lays all the eggs in the colony | A woman who rules a country | A picture card in a pack | A chess piece that moves in straight lines
exercise: Maya says, «I have the queen of hearts.» What kind of queen is this? | A woman who rules a country | The wife of a king | *A picture card | A bee
exercise: In chess, which piece is the strongest? | A pawn | A knight | A rook | *The queen
test: «Charles was crowned with Queen Camilla at Westminster Abbey.» What does queen mean here? | A bee that lays eggs | *The wife of a king | A picture card | A chess piece
test: «The Queen asks Alice if she can play croquet.» Which meaning fits best? | A female insect in the colony | *A woman who rules a country | A queen-sized bed | A card in a pack
exam: In a story, «the Snow Queen waved her hand and the snow swirled.» What does queen mean? | A female insect | The wife of a bee | *A woman who rules a country, here a royal ruler in a story | A picture card
